      "id": "login",
      "name": "Login",
      "category": "ILocalizationServiceProvider",
      "signature": "Login(Target, In Password, In Concurrency, In Operation Complete Delegate)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "ILocalizationServiceProvider*"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Password",
          "type": "String&",
          "default": "FString()"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Concurrency",
          "type": "ELocalizationServiceOperationConcurrency::Type",
          "default": "ELocalizationServiceOperationConcurrency::Synchronous"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Operation Complete Delegate",
          "type": "FLocalizationServiceOperationComplete&",
          "default": "FLocalizationServiceOperationComplete()"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "ELocalizationServiceOperationCommandResult::Type",
      "docs": "Login to the localization service server (if any).\nThis is just a wrapper around Execute().\n@param\tInPassword\t\t\t\t\t\tThe password (if required) to use when logging in.\n@param\tInConcurrency\t\t\t\t\tHow to execute the operation, blocking or asynchronously on another thread.\n@param\tInOperationCompleteDelegate\t\tDelegate to call when the operation is completed. This is called back internal to this call when executed on the main thread, or from Tick() when queued for asynchronous execution.\n@return the result of the operation."
    },
